      "statement": "All POMs resolve the CI-friendly ${revision} placeholder via flatten-maven-plugin, which is pinned to 1.7.3 because unversioned resolution picks up 1.8.0 whose interpolator throws an NPE (mojohaus/flatten-maven-plugin#523); it runs with flattenMode=resolveCiFriendliesOnly and updatePomFile=true at the clean and process-resources phases, so deployed POMs carry fully resolved versions.",
