    {
      "id": "claim_caa61c2be0f3411fb539082c890d1916",
      "statement": "LLM configuration: OPENAI_ORGANIZATION_ID and OPENAI_API_KEY must both be set for OpenAI chat models (creation throws IllegalStateException otherwise); OPENAI_MODEL_NAME and OLLAMA_MODEL_NAME drive the OPENAI_GENERIC and OLLAMA_GENERIC variants; Ollama models target OLLAMA_HOST with either OLLAMA_USER/OLLAMA_PASSWORD basic auth or an OLLAMA_TOKEN on an OpenAI-compatible client; SEED defaults to 422413373 and an unparsable SEED aborts model creation; LLM_CACHE_DIR selects the prompt/response cache directory (default .cache-llm/).",
